      "content_sha256": "353552f947c501d02d882b6e579e94d6ab72ec478ca583b6d5e9c8a250ca22d2"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Recalling that unlike terms (those having different subscripts) in Equations 21.1a,b are uncorrelated under random mating and gametic phase equilibrium (Chapter 5), the genetic variances for each trait can be written as",
