    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "is the additive genetic covariance between characters 1 and 2. The second component of Equation 21.3 is attributable to the covariance of dominance effects, and so on for the epistatic components of variance. Note that when the two traits are the same, Equation 21.3 reduces to 21.2a.",
